  <Document>, no known container, and no record element of the family the
  namespace names. The sniffer resolves pacs.008 from that binding, which is
  correct as far as it goes, and must still report an error - routing this to
  read_pacs008 on `WHERE error IS NULL` would abort with "no
  <FIToFICstmrCdtTrf> found", which is the abort sniff_iso20022 exists to
  prevent.
-->
<Envelope xmlns="urn:iso:std:iso:20022:tech:xsd:pacs.008.001.08">
  <Hdr>
    <Sender>BANKKZKX</Sender>
    <CreDtTm>2026-07-29T09:15:00</CreDtTm>
  </Hdr>
</Envelope>
